Third-party components

The desktop installers built from this repository bundle third-party
libraries under their own licenses, notably PyMuPDF / MuPDF (AGPL-3.0,
https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.html), pywebview (BSD-3-Clause),
python-docx / python-pptx / openpyxl / lxml (MIT / BSD). The complete
corresponding source code of this program, including build scripts, is
published at https://github.com/ramdolphlim/textveil .
